1. Data Transfer : Move data
2. Arithmetic	: Perform calculations
3. Logical	Bit : operations
4. Branching	Control : program flow
5. Machine Control	: Control processor

1.Data transfer instruction: 
  MOV  STA 
  MVI  LHLD
  LXI  SHLD
  LDA  STAX       
  LDAX  XCHG
  IN    OUT
2.Arithmetic operation
  ADD   ADC   ADI  
  SUB   SBB   SUI   
  INR   DCR   ACI
  INX   DCX   SBI
  DAD   DAA
3.Logical operation
  ANA   ANI
  ORA   ORI
  XRA   XRI
  CMP   CPI
  CMA
  CMC   STC
  RLC   RRC   
  RAL   RAR
4.Brancing control
  JMP   JZ   JNZ   JC   JNC   JP   JM   JPE   JPO
  CALL  CZ   CNZ   CC   CNC   CP   CM   CPE   CPO
  RET   RZ   RNZ   RC   RNC   RP   RM   RPE   RPO
  RST   PCHL
5.Machine control
  HLT   NOP   DI   EI   SIM   RIM
